  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/450",
  "contentHtml": "<p>학년말에 많이 하시는 달고나 만들기를 하였습니다.</p><p>2학년의 경우 수업 관련성이 크지 않으나 6. 물질의 특성(순물질, 혼합물), 8.열과 우리 생활(온도에 따른 입자의 운동) 에 관련지어 문지선 선생님의 실험보고서(<a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/378\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/378</a>)를 수정해서 보고서를 만들었습니다. 감사합니다. ^^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e39af6ab1508570862dacf42e7aa163e12cbb08?download\" data-file-name=\"실험보고서-달고나만들기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"435712\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D450%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20231218102849&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F8e39af6ab1508570862dacf42e7aa163e12cbb08')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">실험보고서-달고나만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">425.50KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>편의를 위해 쿠킹호일컵과 핫플레이트를 이용했는데, 녹여서 굳힌 후에 쿠킹호일에서 떼어내기 쉬워서 좋더라구요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c2f2d27598b7f49ee52cc29f951bc774ea71ea1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c2f2d27598b7f49ee52cc29f951bc774ea71ea1\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d8e458ab88f6a486cc6372913bf031ac06ddda4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d8e458ab88f6a486cc6372913bf031ac06ddda4\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2d3fd91964856c4c387c20368211b4c02e38b6e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2d3fd91964856c4c387c20368211b4c02e38b6e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74ed5414c58cf4a59f9ac37335a8c34133384dd7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74ed5414c58cf4a59f9ac37335a8c34133384dd7\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고, 보고서 마지막에 식소다를 넣었을 때 녹은 설탕이 부풀어오르는 현상을 설명해보는 문항을 넣어봤는데, 생각보다 작성하는 것을 어려워 했습니다. 필요하신 분들은 사용하시기 바랍니다. ^^</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
